@startuml Project01_State_Hunting
title Predator — hunting states

[*] --> Searching

Searching --> Searching : nothing spotted,\nkeep wandering
Searching --> Chasing : a butterfly is spotted

Chasing --> Feeding : the butterfly\nis caught
Chasing --> Searching : the butterfly\ngets away

Feeding --> Searching : done, look\nfor the next one

Searching : wandering around,\nlooking for prey
Chasing : targeting one butterfly,\njudging how well it's camouflaged
Feeding : prey caught,\nremoved from the population

@enduml
